  displayName: VAMPIRE
  subtitle: The Longer, The Stronger
  role: BLOOD
  flavorText: 'A noble of the night who needs no blade.

    Every wound he deals
    feeds his blood,

    and a long fight only makes him faster -

    but he starts
    every battle hungry.'
